a) During data collection:
Participants can pause or stop at any time without giving a reason{% if d.uses_prolific %} (Prolific participants can also return their submission){% endif %}. Online participants can close the survey or end the call; in-person participants can leave the session. If they stop, data collected so far are deleted on request. {% if p.pay_on_withdrawal == "full" %}Compensation is paid in full either way.{% else %}Compensation is paid pro rata for the time taken part.{% endif %}

b) After data collection:
Participants can request withdrawal of their data within {{ p.withdrawal }} of taking part by emailing the research team with their participant number (provided on the debrief sheet). No reason is needed; their data are deleted and this is confirmed by email.
